Subject: Reset your SocialOS password

--- text ---
Someone asked to reset the password of your SocialOS account. Open this link to choose a new one:

https://app.example.com/verify-email#token=abc123

The link works once and expires in 48 hours. If this was not you, ignore this message; your password stays the same.

SocialOS

